        "kind": "behavior-change",
        "exposedClass": "review-required",
        "statement": "After the upgrade, the CRD's storage version is v1 instead of v1beta1. Existing ClusterExternalSecret objects keep working and stay stored as v1beta1 until they are rewritten. Nothing is reported to fail or be rejected in this release.",
        "remediation": "Plan a storage version migration before any later release that removes v1beta1: re-write all ClusterExternalSecret objects so they are stored as v1, then update status.storedVersions to drop v1beta1.",
        "severity": "low"
      },
      "statement": "Storage version of `clusterexternalsecrets.external-secrets.io` changes v1beta1 → v1"
